            </note>
            <note corresp="#d206-f2" n="2" xml:id="d206-f2-content">
                <p>The letter is dated July 2; neither the letter nor the memorandum is printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d206-f3" n="3" xml:id="d206-f3-content">
                <p>
                    Rostow added the last sentence by hand.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d206-f4" n="4" xml:id="d206-f4-content">
                <p>Dated June 14, not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d206-f5" n="5" xml:id="d206-f5-content">
                <p>President Johnson checked this option.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
